<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22200" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γίγγλῠμος </span></b> ( <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γιγγλυμός</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>), ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hinge</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἷον εἰ γ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Loc.Hom.</u>
					6
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Apollod.
				<u>Poliorc.</u>
				190.1
			</span></i>: hence a species of <i>joint</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>de An.</u>
				433b22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				2.735
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metal
				<i>pivot</i> or <i>gudgeon</i> on which a door turns, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρόφιγξ</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				4.1484.74
			</span></i> (Epid.), <i><span class="en">
				11(2).165.15
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>):— written <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλυμός</span></b> , ib.<i><span class="en">
				142.49
			</span></i> (an engraver's error). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>joint in a coat of mail</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				12.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>clasp, buckle</i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				3.6.3
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<i>mode of kissing</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
